{"4124910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lunar Mystery 2103", "steam_appid": 4124910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar Mystery 2103 is a sci-fi puzzle-adventure game originally developed for the Game Boy Color. In it, you play as Captain Jaxon Andromeda as he seeks to uncover the mystery of the year-long silence of Earth's only lunar colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2055, mankind colonised the moon, establishing an international lunar hub simply named C01. In 2077, it was finally opened to the public,  enjoying decades of prosperity... Until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the dawn of a new year, 2103, and Earth has not received any form of communication from C01 for over a year. A team of elite lunar specialists was sent to investigate; only one returned... In pieces.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it is up to you, Captain. You must find out what is happening in 2103. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lunar Mystery 2103, you play as Captain Jaxon Andromeda as he seeks to uncover the mystery of the year-long silence of Earth's only lunar colony, C01.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the Answers to a Year-Long Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lunar Mystery 2103 you will need to keep your wits about you as you navigate the labyrinthine corridors of this cold metallic Colony, avoiding the dangers that lurk within, be they robotic, or something else...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/ff3faac688af3177665e27496bd5bb9f.poster.avif?t=1771328308\" width=590 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/ff3faac688af3177665e27496bd5bb9f.webm?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/ff3faac688af3177665e27496bd5bb9f.mp4?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock doors, push debris, realign computer terminals, and more! Puzzles play a key role in Lunar Mystery 2103, testing your skills in a variety of engaging problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/188f6a7d9ff7533ab49f981bfb1f5f6e.poster.avif?t=1771328308\" width=1170 height=1054 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/188f6a7d9ff7533ab49f981bfb1f5f6e.webm?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/188f6a7d9ff7533ab49f981bfb1f5f6e.mp4?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Menacing Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C01 is not so quiet... There are things lurking in its corridors, and they're not ready to let you walk around like you own the place! You will need to tackle them head-on, and ensure their defeat to continue your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/2ba824fb769f119b53867cdbf382881a.poster.avif?t=1771328308\" width=1128 height=1016 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/2ba824fb769f119b53867cdbf382881a.webm?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/2ba824fb769f119b53867cdbf382881a.mp4?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture onto the Lunar Surface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on the cold and unforgiving desert that is the moonscape. Keep an eye on your O2 meter! You don't want to take your last breath out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/12028eecd893ac10fec64ca094de8943.poster.avif?t=1771328308\" width=1170 height=1054 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/12028eecd893ac10fec64ca094de8943.webm?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/12028eecd893ac10fec64ca094de8943.mp4?t=1771328308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Die!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is not an option, Captain. You must succeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124910/extras/0bbff51087129c89009b39a1c50336ca.avif?t=1771328308\" width=1200 height=1018 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar Mystery 2103 is a sci-fi puzzle-adventure game originally developed for the Game Boy Color. In it, you play as Captain Jaxon Andromeda as he seeks to uncover the mystery of the year-long silence of Earth's only lunar colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2055, man